Ya I think it is helpful to be able to see past info on that bleacher.  We had questions about who drove one last that we just sold, and its already been removed so we couldnt see.', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-21 19:12:28.266+00', NULL, NULL),
