	('25be8abb-1b64-4093-a9ba-298fb37edbe4', NULL, NULL, 'Laggy when typing', 'Sometimes it''s laggy when typing on a block. Look into it', 'completed', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2025-07-02 17:38:49.421378+00', '2026-04-29 17:38:39.207064+00', NULL),
	('f7730396-0175-44ff-892e-fb6a2704af61', '5c6c808a-6742-45ab-a048-f73f2e0e6c35', '60f66b67-2e78-4f8f-9b2e-ee04c11c3d40', 'Powersync Local Development', '<p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://docs.powersync.com/self-hosting/local-development">https://docs.powersync.com/self-hosting/local-development</a></p>', 'completed', 0, false, 'f8581174-0fbf-48f4-a7bf-c98516c17b76', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-29 18:12:51.333+00', '2026-04-29 18:12:51.765005+00', NULL),
	('1a35233c-c86e-4413-81fc-07e41e30bd34', '5c6c808a-6742-45ab-a048-f73f2e0e6c35', NULL, 'Work Tracker Status', '<p>Account manager can set the work trackers from "Draft" to "Released". Then Sarah will make the app only display released trips.</p>', 'to_do', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-29 18:14:16.691+00', NULL, NULL),
	('a1d140d8-9a04-4452-bcf8-6aa26212bb85', '5c6c808a-6742-45ab-a048-f73f2e0e6c35', NULL, 'Offline Updates', '<p>Implement Powersync to the mobile application to be able to update completed information for each task</p>', 'completed', 0, false, 'f8581174-0fbf-48f4-a7bf-c98516c17b76', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-29 18:15:06.017+00', '2026-04-29 18:15:06.316707+00', NULL),
	('ca17f94a-1175-4458-a90b-2e8e30bfdaf1', '42fedbbd-2d36-41c0-ad6b-bbe4b8a4d3ed', NULL, 'Put out Job Post for Ukraine', '<p><strong>Full-Stack Developer (Web + Mobile)</strong></p><p>We’re hiring a strong, scrappy full-stack developer to help build and scale a real-world logistics platform used daily by our operations team and drivers.</p><p>This will start as a 1-month paid trial where you’ll work on real features in the codebase and be paid as a contractor. If it’s a strong fit, we’ll transition to a long-term full-time role with the opportunity to become a core part of the team. Some overlap with North American hours (afternoon/evening) will be expected.</p><p></p><p><strong>About the company</strong></p><p>Bleacher Rentals is a rapidly growing provider of state-of-the-art mobile bleachers, operating primarily in the Central and Eastern United States, as well as in Canada. With headquarters in Ontario, Texas, and Florida, the company serves a variety of events, including rodeos, sports competitions, and outdoor gatherings. Initially starting as a local business in southwestern Ontario, Bleacher Rentals quickly expanded due to high demand, becoming a trusted supplier for safe, reliable, and cost-effective event seating. Now, the company is the go-to solution for mobile bleacher rentals, further extending its service reach across borders to meet growing needs.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tech stack</strong></p><ul><li><p>Next.js (React, TypeScript)</p></li><li><p>React Native (Expo)</p></li><li><p>Supabase (Postgres, Auth, Realtime)</p></li><li><p>PowerSync (offline-first sync)</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>What you’ll work on</strong></p><ul><li><p>Web app (Next.js / React) for managing events, bookings, and logistics</p></li><li><p>Mobile app (React Native / Expo) used by drivers in the field</p></li><li><p>Backend logic, database queries, and integrations (Supabase / PowerSync)</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>We’re Looking for Someone Who Gets Shit Done</strong></p><ul><li><p>Scrappy and resourceful - you figure things out without getting stuck</p></li><li><p>Strong problem solver who thinks beyond the obvious</p></li><li><p>Uses AI to move faster, but reviews and takes ownership of the output</p></li><li><p>Takes ownership of work from idea to completion</p></li><li><p>Communicates clearly and proactively in English</p></li><li><p>Cares about building things correctly, not just quickly</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>How to apply</strong><br>Send an email to <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="mailto:josh@bleacherrentals.com">josh@bleacherrentals.com</a> with:</p><ul><li><p>Short intro</p></li><li><p>Links to your GitHub repos</p></li><li><p>Brief example of a problem you solved and how you approached it</p></li></ul><p>• • Your availability for a video call interview</p>', 'completed', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-30 19:05:28.621+00', '2026-04-30 19:05:29.005887+00', NULL),
	('c70acdaf-c6a7-4642-9eab-e0bd92b1672f', '42fedbbd-2d36-41c0-ad6b-bbe4b8a4d3ed', NULL, 'Job Post for Canadians', '<p></p>', 'completed', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-30 19:06:15.271+00', '2026-04-30 19:06:15.419022+00', NULL),
	('1062caca-c63f-4a24-8a45-4e1ce80c73c3', '42fedbbd-2d36-41c0-ad6b-bbe4b8a4d3ed', NULL, 'Anyone should be able to see tickets they''re subscribed to', '<p>Right now when you link to a ticket that''s not in the backlog, the url directs users to "Admin-only" pages. If a user has the uuid to a ticket then they should be able to view it. Probably in the backlog. users should be able to see all items where is_backlog = true OR they''re subscribed to it.</p>', 'to_do', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-30 20:23:37.11+00', NULL, NULL),
	('b17334e7-c703-4cfc-b59d-71324e9e46be', '42fedbbd-2d36-41c0-ad6b-bbe4b8a4d3ed', NULL, 'Inbox', '<p>We should probably have an inbox to show all the conversations that we''re subscribed to with new messages.</p>', 'to_do', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-30 20:38:42.464+00', NULL, NULL),
	('b3cad9ad-939c-41a7-8648-80db57b1f2ab', NULL, NULL, 'email notification for member add', '<p>It would be great if people got an email to notify them when they are added to the team. Ie. when an account manager adds a driver, an email will automatically send to them, notifying them, with a link to download the app.</p>', 'completed', 0, true, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '23b6f483-dd76-4add-baa5-4d07fed608a8', '2026-04-15 17:36:41.095+00', '2026-04-30 21:08:31.453657+00', NULL),
	('c3c30c80-2a2b-4d8d-a0bb-03a1ce18df34', '42fedbbd-2d36-41c0-ad6b-bbe4b8a4d3ed', NULL, 'Email Notification Service', '<p>Made an email alert service for the instant messaging stuff but this should be able to be used for any kind of alert that we come up with</p>', 'completed', 0, false, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-30 21:37:25.726+00', '2026-04-30 21:37:26.27157+00', NULL),
