	('601148b8-acbb-46c1-bb1e-720d7bae8e7d', NULL, NULL, 'Pre selected Dashboard', 'Assign bleachers by number to users,   thesew numbers should be the ones they see on there home screen,    Each user will only be allowed to adit the numbers they are assigned to.  

Maybe a toggle button to show all or show just the bleachers they get to see would be usfull

