The idea is that only one user should have access to a bleachers (the responsible person) at one time,   other then the manager. 

', 'completed', 0, true, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', '2025-08-19 15:26:56.581781+00', '2026-06-02 13:29:09.650369+00', NULL),
	('a98ed355-071a-4299-b220-a3a1a5ac1b88', 'c4d83a6e-28fb-4ac3-9146-4892895595a4', NULL, 'ScoreCard Click to Show Quotes and Bookings', '<p>Should be able to click on a graph in the scorecard and open the quotes and bookings page with these filter options to see where the number came from in the score card.</p><p></p><p>Should also improve the filtering in general on the Quotes and Bookings page</p>', 'to_do', 0, true, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-04-16 19:52:10.75+00', NULL, NULL),
	('3fb7c942-2a44-455c-99ae-307ed942895c', 'c4d83a6e-28fb-4ac3-9146-4892895595a4', NULL, 'Created By date on Quotes and Bookings', '<p></p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-02 13:06:03.917+00', '2026-06-02 14:32:16.357184+00', NULL),
	('dc4d9aab-76a3-4a5b-a951-a3d023717597', NULL, NULL, '4-Row Bleacher Problem', '<p>some trailers hold 12 4-rows, some only hold 4 4-rows and one that only holds 6.<br><br>What do we do on the dashboard? How do we say "This customer gets 4 and this customer gets 6 etc?" same trailer can go to multiple events to drop a bunch of bleacher at a time.</p>', 'to_do', 0, true, NULL, '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-03 13:42:00.81+00', NULL, NULL),
	('0d5d7478-e808-488d-81bd-7bea728b09a7', 'c4d83a6e-28fb-4ac3-9146-4892895595a4', '99776dbb-8ab2-4d98-bc73-d808d106bc5e', 'Generate PDF for Quotes', '<p>Refer to the work trackers quotes feature: src/app/work-trackers/[startDate]/[userUuid]/pdf/route.tsx<br>src/app/work-trackers/[startDate]/[userUuid]/page.tsx<br>src/features/workTrackers/components/PdfComponent.tsx</p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-01 13:30:05.359+00', '2026-06-03 14:07:07.502447+00', NULL),
	('64825f7c-18c1-4a32-82f2-38c458a71bc2', 'c4d83a6e-28fb-4ac3-9146-4892895595a4', NULL, 'BUG - Account Managers and Viewers cannot see permissions page', '<p></p>', 'completed', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-03 16:58:26.045+00', '2026-06-03 16:58:27.381391+00', NULL),
	('a3464410-dbd8-4424-b6ac-f35d866406e6', 'c4d83a6e-28fb-4ac3-9146-4892895595a4', '4f57b8cd-0145-4667-b7af-7f97effe5350', 'BUG - Drivers Cannot Accept Trips', '<p></p>', 'to_do', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-03 16:58:48.26+00', NULL, NULL),
	('2d60f9f8-c957-4103-8021-dbfa341caff2', 'c4d83a6e-28fb-4ac3-9146-4892895595a4', NULL, 'BUG - Account Managers Cannot Edit Existing Work Trackers', '<p>After we pushed these changes to the work trackers the created_by_user_uuid is null on exsiting work trackers so they can''t edit existing ones. create backfill migration<br><br><strong>Can this account manager edit this work tracker?</strong></p><ul><li><p>If you own this bleacher then yes. </p></li><li><p>if you don''t own the driver then doesn''t matter</p></li></ul><p></p><p></p>', 'to_do', 0, false, '43f82f56-f6e2-4400-aeb2-7c5195c557ad', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', '2026-06-03 17:00:37.809+00', NULL, NULL);


