Thank you', 'f626a402-3ecf-4e5e-9ef6-0c03e8126264', '746927fc-e6c7-4cff-b7a4-a12130a5c3d6', 'bug', 'backlog'),
	('2026-03-05 13:32:03.182+00', 'Dates Error', 'When entering the dates, it is not showing up correct on the software. It keeps making it 1-3 days before or after the date i entered.', '5fb71712-cd8f-4c66-b613-6da8a8925bf1', 'fae8f510-96d3-4437-b184-45be5c4b7007', 'bug', 'backlog'),
	('2026-04-08 18:35:17.825+00', 'work trackers', 'Need a way to email work trackers so that they get a live work tracker for payroll. and assigning loads', '5f1f5654-8bfe-4bba-a21d-5fdc3b941239', '23b6f483-dd76-4add-baa5-4d07fed608a8', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2026-04-09 17:29:26.345+00', 'account managers adding drivers', 'For one-off/ occasional drivers, would it be possible for account managers to manually add new driver profiles to create work trackers?', '87784dc4-aba3-4906-8535-b812417f90e2', '23b6f483-dd76-4add-baa5-4d07fed608a8', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-06-26 00:46:48.216314+00', 'SetupTeardown Alert Fix', 'Get rid of alert when teardown and setup are overlapping by just one day.', '94e9f3e0-ca62-4635-9fbc-89044b55a15c', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'approved'),
	('2026-04-12 14:04:37.308+00', 'Change of bleacher route', 'when a driver has accepted a trip, and then I go to change routing. I want to assign that trip to a new driver. Can it notify the original driver that I have taken that trip away from him?  Or even if an event cancelled and a driver already has accepted the trip, can he get a notification that the haul has been deleted ? and I no longer need him for  this? -Denver', '71544646-6359-40e7-ae9e-64050cce7265', '5847580c-471a-481e-92f7-582e7441eff4', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2026-04-15 17:36:41.095+00', 'email notification for member add', 'It would be great if people got an email to notify them when they are added to the team. 
Ie. when an account manager adds a driver, an email will automatically send to them, notifying them, with a link to download the app. ', 'b3cad9ad-939c-41a7-8648-80db57b1f2ab', '23b6f483-dd76-4add-baa5-4d07fed608a8', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2026-04-16 19:52:10.75+00', 'ScoreCard Click to Show Quotes and Booksing', 'Should be able to click on a graph in the scorecard and open the quotes and bookings page with these filter options to see where the number came from in the score card.', 'a98ed355-071a-4299-b220-a3a1a5ac1b88', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2026-04-21 19:12:28.266+00', 'View historical data for deleted blechers', 'Michelle Adcock  [2:07 PM]
If an asset gets deleted/removed from the schedule, how/can we access the prior history of events/drivers, and any info attached to it?
Josh Redgrift  [2:09 PM]
It’s still in the database it’s just marked as deleted, but I’m not sure there’s any way to see historical events for a bleacher that’s marked as deleted. Maybe I could add this to the quotes and bookings page?
Michelle Adcock  [2:23 PM]
Ya I think it is helpful to be able to see past info on that bleacher.  We had questions about who drove one last that we just sold, and its already been removed so we couldnt see.', 'bd9dd7b2-76df-4ab7-b196-ad2c23e54f05', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2026-04-27 15:13:58.115+00', 'Set up / tear down', 'Set up and tear down doesnt have locations so the zones dont appear in bills. Could we tie the set up and tear down to the event location so when pushed to QBO, they are zoned properly', '8f29afce-099b-42e6-bbf0-703b95cf23fa', '788a4690-2a6f-4ad7-9365-3669d230aee0', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-08-15 15:58:59.910257+00', 'override colors', 'add a setting in event tab so that we can over ride the color of the event', '187fce71-7968-4e13-a556-77c5410bc0b4', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-08-06 17:14:34.410444+00', 'Laggy only in yellow boxes', 'when typing in yellow boxes sometimes the text can take like 8 seconds to update.', '85b265eb-c853-4b34-8dc9-e95239475592', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-10-29 12:28:53.363974+00', 'search bar', 'Add a search bar for event look up', '7990fea0-1a89-4913-9faa-fbcf16e1d1c4', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-11-18 20:40:48.524247+00', 'Drivers App', 'Pre/Post Trip Inspections- Google form already created.  Drivers accepting/approving delivery/pick up (delivery confirmation check box- then it asks did you do your post trip inspection- allow to add set up photos etc) Documents- upload documents drivers need ie- blue books.  Instructional videos- on our website already www.bleacherrentals.com/driver Password:BRdriver. Ability to send documents for signatures ie: rate cards, policies etc. Driver profile- phone number, email, address, do they have storage space for bleachers,  upload drivers license, medical card etc to profile.  Messaging feature- send/receive messages like text with drivers right through the app. ', 'b8f4f6b5-432a-4374-ad5d-7d7ba6f18a1c', '04d8fe31-ba63-4037-8f89-c6383bdcfade', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-11-18 20:43:12.263236+00', 'Maintenance ', 'Be able to book a bleacher out for maintenance so the team knows when a bleacher is out of service for repairs.(highlight in red) Allow to add address of shop if being taken to a shop for repairs. ', 'bcc6d70a-8dc3-456d-b3cf-1193553b0bf2', '04d8fe31-ba63-4037-8f89-c6383bdcfade', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2026-01-23 14:53:55.542301+00', 'New bleacher type', 'Add a new bleacher row in the asset list.  10 row canopy.  ', 'bfd69fcc-02b2-4158-b5a8-a8691ca4412c', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-08-06 17:17:24.925995+00', 'Bleacher info on work tracker', 'In the bleacher number column, include the hitch type and the number of rows. This means I''ll need to add a new field to the bleacher in the assets page called "Hitch type" and then someone is going to need to input all the hitch types in the existing bleachers.', '2d1a2b94-a69b-4651-a5bc-49aae3e8ff04', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-08-06 17:24:07.048882+00', 'Work Tracker Location should affect bleache location', 'Now that we have work trackers the drop off location of the work tracker should affect the bleacher location on the sticky left column.', '05007e04-3926-41f0-8256-169945944fa5', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-08-19 15:26:56.581781+00', 'Pre selected Dashboard', 'Assign bleachers by number to users,   thesew numbers should be the ones they see on there home screen,    Each user will only be allowed to adit the numbers they are assigned to.  

Maybe a toggle button to show all or show just the bleachers they get to see would be usfull

Admin or full access should be granted for managers

Temp access should be available with date ranges,  for example,  denver uses a florida bleachers for 3 months in the summer,  he can have temp access to that bleachers between set dates,  IE.  June 15 to Sept 21,   at that point,  it will show up for denver,  

Maybe this can be greyed out for the owner of the use during these dates and opened up for the new user,   

The idea is that only one user should have access to a bleachers (the responsible person) at one time,   other then the manager. 

', '601148b8-acbb-46c1-bb1e-720d7bae8e7d', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-10-30 13:46:02.110987+00', 'edit the work tracker page', 'would like this to show each week,  then under the week show the list of drivers,   rather then the drivers then the week.  


Then we have a check box that states when the drivers are ready to be paid,  and another to check after they were paid.  

Seperate list for canadian drivers and us drivers', '20dca169-3529-46a9-88cf-4eb8882af0d9', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-10-30 13:53:20.863908+00', 'default to summer homebase', 'move the bleacher sorting to a toggle switch on th etop,    default list shows summer homebase,   toggle  to switch to winter or all bleachers.  ', 'd6cada42-d004-4483-a29e-01e82a7fb055', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-11-13 14:09:10.685741+00', 'Dashboard and KPI''s', 'I''d like to create a dashboard with metrics that are public for all to see.   

But i''m woundering if we need a private list that shows only the login users events in a list sorted by date,  so they can easily switch the event to confirmed,  rather then going in the dashboard list.  
 

Anyways,   forward looking metrics are. 

# of Quotes sent, 
Value of quotes sent
# of signed quotes, 
Value of signed quotes,  


Evergreen metrics.  (past looking) 
Main metric = ROI on assets under managerment.  (total asset value under manager / Gross profit)

Sub KPI''s to get this number,  
Total value of events (using event starting date for entire event value)

Total costs of delivery,   =. all work trackers totals.  

Gross margin percentage = total event value divided by total costs of delvery(work trackers)

Gross profit = Total event value - total cost of delvery

Total bleacher value,   = total value of bleachers under management,  (winter is dec 1 to juine 1,  summer is june 1 to dec 1,).   we will require to put value of each asset in the suystem for this.  
  ', 'cd44f9f9-7067-4530-9552-5ae001ed750f', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-11-14 18:10:41.998799+00', 'Wrapped Text', 'Could we wrap the text in the box? Just to make it look neater especially when we have event to event quotes. ', '45ece3a9-00fa-4e97-a07e-0fb8794dde82', 'fae8f510-96d3-4437-b184-45be5c4b7007', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-11-17 20:50:47.343293+00', 'Account manager access', 'Account managers will need to have access to the work trackers on the left side. When I switched from Admin to Account manager, Assets, team and work trackers all became hidden for me. - Denver ', 'a57915eb-306e-489a-94ab-c8b0851acba2', '5847580c-471a-481e-92f7-582e7441eff4', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-12-06 01:43:57.837075+00', 'drivers rate', 'When changing drivers rate it wont let me choose usd or mile/hourly. ', '3eee3d55-497c-4284-af60-26d2b436e0ce', '6b080032-c889-4ce5-86e0-5a564a4d97f7', 'bug', 'backlog'),
	('2025-12-10 13:20:57.746328+00', 'Work tracker- no bleachers', 'Josh, just doing the work trackers this week.. anyway there can be an option of not selecting a bleacher? 99% of the time this is for when we have to do site visits.. that could be an option maybe there is a bleacher called " Site Visit" or just an option to select no bleacher.  But I need to be able to put this line item on the work trackers.  Call/ msg me if this is confusing. thanks!', 'c657823e-3963-419a-a4cf-d29c188b43a4', '5847580c-471a-481e-92f7-582e7441eff4', 'feature', 'backlog'),
	('2025-06-26 00:48:01.885869+00', 'User Permissions Bug', 'When a user first creates an account it turns them into an account manager if they were an admin. Do capitals in the email do weird things?', '3ec30869-3db4-42b3-a557-19315f274c6b', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'bug', 'backlog'),
	('2025-11-14 18:48:31.406189+00', 'Home Base when entering events', 'If I am entering an event in SC or NC and selecting bleachers, it won''t create event because it says " can''t find home base".', 'df0fdb08-970e-40b3-bc53-06b0bf0ce2f2', 'fae8f510-96d3-4437-b184-45be5c4b7007', 'bug', 'backlog'),
	('2026-01-20 19:44:22.049311+00', 'Quote events issue', 'It seems, you can''t delete bleachers from a quote event. Been trying to swap around, and add some bleachers to a quote event and nothing happens when I do so. Even when I refresh the page. ', '0e4991e4-663c-465d-a612-0833390cafac', '5847580c-471a-481e-92f7-582e7441eff4', 'bug', 'backlog'),
	('2025-06-26 19:31:46.114245+00', 'Description for Asset', 'JOSH: Add new column to the bleacher table called description

When adding a bleacher, it would be handy to have a drop down for hitch type: Bumper, or Gooseneck. This is helpful when scheduling drivers for delivery as not all drivers have both hitches on their trucks. 

Also for the 4 rows it would be nice to label if they are hinging or not. 

Add ', '030a720d-6f26-4ecb-930a-e157b6b30dd7', '04d8fe31-ba63-4037-8f89-c6383bdcfade', 'feature', 'approved'),
	('2025-08-01 14:41:46.986027+00', 'Default Template', 'A template would be preselected with home bases on the bleacher view and preselected with states/provinces on the event view. A user should be able to build their own template by selecting this data and then by default they would only see this data everytime they log in.', 'e93cdebb-2891-4a1f-aedb-38af77033a9c', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'approved'),
	('2025-07-28 15:00:40.312656+00', 'Prompt For Creating An Event With No Bleachers', 'When someone first creates an event they tend to forget to add a bleacher to it so I think if someone clicks save event with no bleachers selected, you should see a prompt saying "Forgetting something? 🥴"  Then maybe some text saying that this event has no bleachers selected. Do you want to select a bleacher for this event before saving? - Yes/ No', '2b641d42-6ee3-40c0-b6b5-c6496365a6ec', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'approved'),
	('2025-08-15 16:00:16.791895+00', 'Allow users to choose color on event', 'Incase a color is too close to other events', '42112bbc-15b6-42f1-870c-02f7a7a9a2ae', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'approved'),
	('2025-08-15 15:50:21.583591+00', 'Bug when scrolling down on events axis', 'When you scroll down on the events axis it throws a client side exception.', 'e58772d7-e74c-4133-89cc-3840ba1e14bd', '5869439d-bfc2-4ae3-adc0-27bc9f42a712', 'bug', 'approved'),
	('2025-08-15 16:01:45.783573+00', 'Displaying bleacher id instead of bleacher number in work tracker', 'It''s showing the bleacher id not the bleacher number in the work trascker in work trackers page. So in production bleacher 43 is displaying as bleacher 44', 'a6800e3d-6335-4023-8349-516f449a3411', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'bug', 'approved'),
	('2025-06-26 00:48:22.355155+00', 'Add Contact Info To Event', 'This contact info would be defining who should be contacted when the driver arrives with the bleachers. This will mainly come in handy when the driver app comes out.', '9c98aa17-81c7-4b97-8e2e-b419039122cc', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'in_progress'),
	('2025-08-01 14:29:37.969041+00', 'POC On Event & Autopoulate Work Tracker', 'Put a POC field on the event config. then when linking a worktracker pickup event you can auto populate the POC to the WT', '01b30728-6859-4bcf-b4a5-80df29649bdb', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'feature', 'in_progress'),
	('2025-06-27 18:45:31.324919+00', 'sameday setup teardown', 'sameday setup teardown looks weird. This is actually an issue with an event that is only one day long, and has same day setup and teardown. I gotta find a way to make this not look so bad.', '165faab4-2d08-4ced-9b73-ea6ee54b513c', '9bddb34c-d84e-4d11-852a-27f16de08379', 'bug', 'paused'),
	('2025-08-01 14:36:52.789356+00', 'Pay Auto Populate', 'Use Google Maps API to get the distrance to drive for the driver. Use non-toll roads. 

Add driver rate field to driver config based on milage. $ per Km maybe do the mile drop down if easy and not a rabit hole.

